136	- [ ] **Step 2: Append focus, motion, and responsive layers**
137	
138	The old stylesheet had **zero** focus rules. This is the fix.
139	
140	```css
141	/* ==========================================================================
142	   13. FOCUS VISIBILITY
143	   ========================================================================== */
144	:focus-visible {
145	    outline: 2px solid var(--accent);
146	    outline-offset: 2px;
147	    border-radius: var(--r-sm);
148	}
